Date: Tue, 25 Jun 2024 18:38:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add CheckAuxProofOfWork and use it in validation etc. (#4)

Also update places where regtest blocks are mined

Original-Commit: f9a9a4bd0187ebb0a46bd516fa7f31383968cb44
